#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/index.rst:4
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Procedural window generator for Blender based on real-life PVC window profiles and hardware. In this documentation you can find how to use the generator, future plans on development and updates."
msgstr "Generador procedural de ventanas para Blender basado en perfiles de ventanas de PVC y herrajes reales. En esta documentación aprenderás a usar el generador y encontrarás los planes de desarrollo y las actualizaciones."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/index.rst:6
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Supported Blender versions: **4.2 LTS and later** (tested up to 5.3)"
msgstr "Versiones de Blender compatibles: **4.2 LTS y posteriores** (probado hasta 5.3)"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/index.rst:9
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "This is the documentation for WindowGen 4. For WindowGen 3, which also supports Blender 4.0 and 4.1, see the `3.0 documentation <https://windowgen-documentation.readthedocs.io/en/3.0/>`_."
msgstr "Esta es la documentación de WindowGen 4. Para WindowGen 3, que también es compatible con Blender 4.0 y 4.1, consulta la `documentación 3.0 <https://windowgen-documentation.readthedocs.io/en/3.0/>`_."

